## Font Scanner → system font discovery

The serpantinum font scanner only finds fonts in `assets/fonts` and `~/.local/state/serpantinum/fonts`.

**Missing**: `/usr/share/fonts`, `~/.local/share/fonts`, `/usr/local/share/fonts`.

FontPicker shows only what the scanner finds — system-installed fonts are invisible.

**Fix**: Expand the `fontFetcher` Process in `ThemeBackend.qml` to also scan system paths via `fc-list` instead of manually searching directories.

Nerd Font glyphs (PUA codepoints like U+F0320) are shared across ALL Nerd Font variants — Iosevka Nerd Font glyphs render on JetBrains Nerd Font too. Only one Nerd Font family needs to be installed system-wide.
